<span style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111;">$1,650</span>
<span style="font-size:13px;color:#2e7d32;">▲ 2.4X THE LOWEST BRACKET</span>
<span style="font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-left:auto;">FEDERAL 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; BY TAXABLE INCOME BRACKET</span>
</div>
<div style="padding:12px 14px 8px;">
